        <body>
            <div xml:id="d464">

                <pb facs="0804" n="734" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg734"/>

                <head>No. 465.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Francis to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 8, 1883</date>.
                        (Received January 27.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 23.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    summary of the Portuguese budget for the fiscal year 1883–1884, as presented to
                    the Cortes by Señor Fontes, minister of finance, on the 5th instant. The items
                    embrace estimates for the year and indicate a deficit in the receipts to cover
                    expenditures of a comparatively small amount, greatly less than in any former
                    year for a long time back.</p>
                <p>Another report by the minister of finance not yet submitted to the Cortes will
                    show the present condition of the treasury and the amount of the floating
                    debt.</p>
                <p>The present debt of Portugal is about $435,000,000, upon which annual interest of
                    about $14,000,000 is paid. I do not give the precise sums for the reason that no
                    official statements of them have been made, but the amounts named very nearly
                    approximate to the fact.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN M. FRANCIS.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d464-a1.xml" xpointer="d464-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
